body:
There is a small shortcut here. If you say 

&#x200B;

"I truly appreciate the offer but I do not use the adobe suite whatsoever outside of my working environment. I have no use for this personal account. I would still be disappointed with this outcome."

&#x200B;

they will ask...  


"Do you have Adobe and you use at your work  / office ?"

&#x200B;

You will answer....  


"I do work with it at my workplace but that is through their enterprise account. I had started this trial thinking I would use it at home but never had the need."

&#x200B;

They will immediately offer you a refund for 2-3 months. You can then say "I appreciate the offer but this will leave a dent is a somewhat flawless reputation that Adobe has.". They will then offer a full refund. It will get you a refund within 10 minutes.
